{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Possess a Demon, Stop the Angel Forces.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your death comes as the Combo Meter depletes.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fall.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>There will always be more Angels to kill.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3981020/extras/91f8245c482e100e0cc2ab4f5a15423d.poster.avif?t=1767743178\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3981020/extras/91f8245c482e100e0cc2ab4f5a15423d.webm?t=1767743178\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3981020/extras/91f8245c482e100e0cc2ab4f5a15423d.mp4?t=1767743178\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a geek devil. You've received a possession file that can access and take control of the nervous system of an Automatic Infernal Defense Unit (<strong>AIDU</strong>). For <strong>AIDU</strong>, the only way to survive is to absorb the soul essence from the Angel Forces.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Double Jump, Slide, Back Slide, Slam, Dash, Dash Jump,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shoot, Charge Shoot, Reload Parry, Counter,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>AND KILL.</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chain your movesets, land your bullets, and <strong>Fall</strong>.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>KEY FEATURES:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ultra Fast Paced, Character-Action, Free-Fall Combat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Never-Ending, Ever-Changing Vertical Levels without any loading screen</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Various Upgrades for your Gun and Character.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5 Different Unique Levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >15 Types of Unique Enemies</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3981020?t=1767743178","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3981020?t=1767743178","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3981020/e52f00c95bdc6198691018f36c5c60982ff304a7/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1767743178","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3981020/e52f00c95bdc6198691018f36c5c60982ff304a7/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1767743178","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":4000130,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Possess a Demon, Stop the Angel Forces.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your death comes as the Combo Meter depletes.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fall.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>There will always be more Angels to kill.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3981020/extras/91f8245c482e100e0cc2ab4f5a15423d.poster.avif?t=1767743178\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3981020/extras/91f8245c482e100e0cc2ab4f5a15423d.webm?t=1767743178\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3981020/extras/91f8245c482e100e0cc2ab4f5a15423d.mp4?t=1767743178\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a geek devil. You've received a possession file that can access and take control of the nervous system of an Automatic Infernal Defense Unit (<strong>AIDU</strong>). For <strong>AIDU</strong>, the only way to survive is to absorb the soul essence from the Angel Forces.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Double Jump, Slide, Back Slide, Slam, Dash, Dash Jump,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shoot, Charge Shoot, Reload Parry, Counter,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>AND KILL.</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chain your movesets, land your bullets, and <strong>Fall</strong>.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>KEY FEATURES:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ultra Fast Paced, Character-Action, Free-Fall Combat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Never-Ending, Ever-Changing Vertical Levels without any loading screen</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Various Upgrades for your Gun and Character.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5 Different Unique Levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >15 Types of Unique Enemies</p></li></ul>","developers":["Bheismarque"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3981020/42c8c112e4ef4d05acc17066b8a381745b2877b3/header.jpg?t=1767743178","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3981020/1507871748/7ae16b4c5934ecf5245c1e3ffc5fb8d6679561c8/1758653969/dash_av1.mpd?t=1758660686","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3981020/1507871748/7ae16b4c5934ecf5245c1e3ffc5fb8d6679561c8/1758653969/dash_h264.mpd?t=1758660686","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3981020/1507871748/7ae16b4c5934ecf5245c1e3ffc5fb8d6679561c8/1758653969/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1758660686","id":257204963,"name":"Hell Thug Gameplay Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/a